  "body": "I think it would be better if the network specific bits were handled before handing off to that algorithm. That would make fixing #158 easier. It seems there's only one invocation from the network side. Presumably that invocation is due to https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#process-response?\n\n(Why is the label video and not media?)\n",
